flowchart TD
    A[USB Camera Frame] --> B[Haar Face Detection]
    B --> C{Face detected?}
    C -->|No| D{Speaker locked?}
    C -->|Yes| E[FaceMesh 5pt + Align 112x112]
    E --> F[ArcFace Embedding]
    F --> G{Matches enrolled speaker?}
    G -->|No| H[Ignore other faces]
    G -->|Yes| I{Locked on speaker?}
    I -->|No| J[Auto-lock or manual lock]
    I -->|Yes| K[Compute horizontal error vs frame center]
    K --> L{Within deadzone?}
    L -->|Yes| M[Publish CENTERED]
    L -->|No| N{Error left or right?}
    N -->|Left| O[Publish MOVED_LEFT]
    N -->|Right| P[Publish MOVED_RIGHT]
    D -->|Yes, lost briefly| Q[Publish STOPPED hold]
    D -->|Yes, lost longer| R[Publish SEARCHING]
    R --> S{Still missing many frames?}
    S -->|Yes| T[Publish OUT_OF_FRAME search continues]
    S -->|No| R
    T --> U{Speaker reacquired?}
    R --> U
    U -->|Yes| V[Publish STOPPED then track]
    U -->|No| R
    M --> W[MQTT vision/Corene/servo_control]
    O --> W
    P --> W
    Q --> W
    R --> W
    T --> W
    V --> W
    W --> X[ESP32 GPIO14 Servo]
    W --> Y[Status JSON vision/Corene/status]
    W --> Z[Heartbeat vision/Corene/heartbeat]
